```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "osi-layer-runner", title: "OSI Layer Runner", seed: "osi-layer-01",
  theme: { preset: "neon" },

  learning: {
    subject: "Jaringan Komputer",
    concept: "Perangkat jaringan berdasarkan lapisan OSI (Physical, Data Link, Network)",
    objectives: ["Mengelompokkan perangkat jaringan ke lapisan OSI yang tepat"],
    misconceptions: ["Hub dianggap sama dengan Switch, padahal Hub di Physical dan Switch di Data Link"],
    mode: "category",
    categories: [
      { id: "physical",  label: "Physical",  color: "#00E5FF" },
      { id: "datalink",  label: "Data Link", color: "#FF3DCB" },
      { id: "network",   label: "Network",   color: "#FFD23F" }
    ],
    items: [
      { id: "hub",       label: "Hub",           category: "physical", explain: "Meneruskan sinyal listrik ke semua port; bekerja di lapisan fisik." },
      { id: "repeater",  label: "Repeater",      category: "physical", explain: "Memperkuat dan meneruskan sinyal; murni lapisan fisik." },
      { id: "kabel-utp", label: "Kabel UTP",     category: "physical", explain: "Media transmisi fisik berupa kabel tembaga." },
      { id: "switch",    label: "Switch",        category: "datalink", explain: "Meneruskan frame berdasarkan MAC address; lapisan data link." },
      { id: "bridge",    label: "Bridge",        category: "datalink", explain: "Menghubungkan dua segmen LAN lewat MAC address." },
      { id: "nic",       label: "NIC",           category: "datalink", explain: "Kartu jaringan dengan alamat MAC; bekerja di data link." },
      { id: "router",    label: "Router",        category: "network",  explain: "Mengarahkan paket antar jaringan memakai alamat IP." },
      { id: "modem",     label: "Modem",         category: "network",  explain: "Mengubah sinyal dan menangani pengalamatan jaringan." },
      { id: "access-point", label: "Access Point", category: "network", explain: "Menghubungkan perangkat nirkabel ke jaringan; lapisan network." }
    ],
    target: { rotateAfterCorrect: 5, bias: 0.5 }
  },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 360, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 6 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "server", w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "kabel-kusut", w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: true },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 15, speed: 25 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

**OSI Layer Runner** adalah game Endless Runner bertema Neon di mana pemain memilah perangkat jaringan sesuai lapisan OSI yang menjadi target. Asumsi penting: Access Point saya tempatkan di kategori Network sesuai PRD, meski di lapisan OSI murni ia juga menyentuh Data Link.
